## Phase 1

- Doc-shell built on shadcn-svelte's `sidebar-07` block.
- Docs, Components, Blocks, and Utilities sections, backed by a file-based registry catalog.
- Live component previews, syntax-highlighted source, and manual install instructions on every item page.
- Light/dark theming with a no-flash toggle.
- Storybook stories colocated with each registry item.
